9,"fmp_official_ev":207944.9,"dcf_model_ev":863609.6,"ev_to_ebitda":4.5,"debt_to_ebitda":1.34,"net_debt_to_ebitda":0.66,"f_score":5,"f_score_breakdown":[],"fair_val":373.89,"default_fair_val":373.89,"premium_pct":-75.8,"is_undervalued":true,"pe_trailing":11.3,"pe_forward":9.9,"pb_trailing":1.6,"pb_forward":1.4,"div_yield":4.25,"ps_ratio":3.1,"fcf_to_ev":1.89,"fcf_to_mcap":8.12,"liab_to_assets":58.3,"cash_to_assets":10.1,"current_ratio":1.06,"roe":13.9,"roa":5.7,"moat":{"m1_brand_pricing":{"score":5},"m2_patents_regulatory":{"score":7},"m3_high_switching_costs":{"score":6},"m4_network_effects":{"score":2},"m5_cost_advantage_scale":{"score":8},"m6_unique_geography_assets":{"score":8},"m7_operational_efficiency":{"score":6},"m8_capital_allocation":{"score":7},"m9_customer_retention":{"score":4},"m10_durability":{"score":9},"overall_moat_verdict_zh":"TotalEnergies SE本質上是一家全球性的「能源收費橋樑」型企業，其護城河主要來自於極致的規模經濟、難以複製的全球綜合資產基礎，以及高度資本密集和監管嚴格的產業進入壁壘。公司對全球能源供應至關重要，擁有龐大的油氣儲備和基礎設施。然而，面對全球能源轉型，其核心化石燃料業務的長期需求確定性面臨挑戰。管理層正積極透過投資再生能源來適應，這考驗其資本配置的智慧。儘管如此，其現有資產的不可複製性和營運規模，仍使其在可預見的未來保持強大的競爭優勢，但需警惕轉型風險。","overall_moat_verdict_en":"TotalEnergies SE fundamentally operates as a global 'energy toll bridge' enterprise, with its moats primarily stemming from extreme economies of scale, an irreproducible integrated global asset base, and high capital-intensive and heavily regulated industry entry barriers. The company is crucial to global energy supply, possessing vast oil and gas reserves and infrastructure. However, facing the global energy transition, the long-term demand certainty for its core fossil fuel business is challenged. Management is actively adapting by investing in renewables, which tests its capital allocation wisdom. Nevertheless, the irreproducibility of its existing assets and operational scale ensure a strong competitive advantage for the foreseeable future, though transition risks must be monitored."},"ratingSources":{"moat":{"reason":null},"fScore":{"score":5,"checkedAt":null}}